<title>HONG KONG: Wah Nam interim net loss HK$15.44 mln.</title>
<headline>Wah Nam interim net loss HK$15.44 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   1.10 loss  vs 3.21 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  1.20 loss  vs 17.65 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    15.44 loss vs 38.87 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     90.20	vs 100.60</p>
<p>    Company name		 Wah Nam Group Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Wah Nam Group is an investment holding company with subsidiaries engaging in the making of consumer electronic and electrical products, plastic and electrical goods and ceramics tiles, property investment and construction and administration of infrastructure projects.</p>
<p>The company changed its finanial year end to December 31 from April 30. Comparative figures are for six months ended October 31, 1995.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss on disposal of investment property. Share earnings are based on a weighted average of 1.41 billion shares vs 1.21 billion.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
